-- **!T and **?T are NOT equivalent to each other
-- **!Int ≁ **?Int

-- **!Int is NOT equivalent to *!Int (shared sender)
-- **!Int ≁ *!Int

-- **!Int is NOT equivalent to !Int (linear session send)
-- **!Int ≁ !Int;End

-- **?Int is NOT equivalent to *?Int
-- **?Int ≁ *?Int

-- **?Int is NOT equivalent to ?Int;End
-- **?Int ≁ ?Int;End

-- **!T is NOT equivalent to **!U when T ≁ U
-- **!Int ≁ **!Char

-- Covariance: **!T ≡ **!U when T ≡ U (reflexivity)
-- **!Int ≡ **!Int

-- **?Int ≡ **?Int